# UI test: a value whose type is a hole nothing filled (SC0526).
#
# Decision 2 defaults an unconstrained *numeric* literal to `I64` or `F64`, so
# `let n be 1` is not this. `null` has no numeric kind to default to and no
# annotation to read, and inference is local to one body, so there is nothing
# left to wait for.
#
# Reported once per inference class, not once per expression.

def main():
    let missing be null
